					"text" : "Hollywood is in <a href=\"https:\/\/www.britannica.com\/place\/Los-Angeles-California\">Los Angeles<\/a>, California. Lying northwest of downtown Los Angeles, it is bounded by Hyperion Avenue and Riverside Drive (east), Beverly Boulevard (south), the foothills of the&nbsp;Santa Monica Mountains&nbsp;(north), and&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.britannica.com\/place\/Beverly-Hills\">Beverly Hills<\/a>&nbsp;(west)."
